{
  "about": "Guild positions (issue #103): the first makes guild PosTest and invites the second (RUSTNAROK_CLIENT_GUILD=accept). On the members page the master right-clicks the second and moves them to 'Position 2'; both windows follow and the title under the second's name follows (ZC_GUILD_POSITION). On the positions page the master switches position 1's invite box, renames it 'Officer' and sets its tax to 10; the second's window and the title follow. The second leaves from their own row on the members page (asked first); the first sees them go. @breakguild ends it. Both characters must start without a guild or clan. If a run stops between the invitation and leaving, the second stays in PosTest and the next run fails at the invitation: log in as the second, leave from the members page, then @breakguild as the first (the scenario reset can't take a member out of a guild).",
